<title>HUNGARY: Hungary April CPI up 1.4 pct m/m, 18.6 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Hungary April CPI up 1.4 pct m/m, 18.6 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's April consumer price index (CPI) rose 1.4 percent from March, and was 18.6 percent year-on-year, the Central Statistical Office said on Monday.</p>
<p>    HUNGARY'S CPI	    April 1997   March 1997   April 1996</p>
<p>    month-on-month (pct)     +1.4	   +1.9	   +1.6</p>
<p>    year-on-year (pct)	+18.6	  +18.8	  +24.4</p>
<p>	 -- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
